{
  "title": { "zh": "颜色分割" },
  "tray": "recognition",
  "after": {
    "zh": "不用告诉它什么是前景，k 均值自己把像素分成两堆。可它只看亮度：亮度一样的两样东西，它分不开。"
  },
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "托盘里的<part-ref to=\"kmeansStep\"></part-ref>按分界 m 把值分成两类，输出两类平均值的正中间。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "这一关你要做的：从起始分界出发走三步，再把每个像素分成两类。"
      },
      "fig": { "test": 1, "caption": { "zh": "第二组：右边一条" } }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "9-3",
      "kind": "graph",
      "brief": {
        "zh": "从给定的起始分界出发做三步 k 均值，再按最后的分界把每个像素分成两类：亮的一类输出 1。"
      },
      "hint": {
        "zh": "起始的分界可能离得很远。"
      },
      "inputs": ["img", "m"],
      "inputLabels": {
        "img": { "zh": "图" },
        "m": { "zh": "起始的分界" }
      },
      "scene": "kmeans",
      "setup": { "expect": "segment" },
      "tests": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "圆斑" },
          "img": { "twoTone": { "seed": 51, "dark": 0.25, "bright": 0.75, "disc": [5, 6, 16] } },
          "m": 0.28
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "右边一条" },
          "img": { "twoTone": { "seed": 52, "dark": 0.2, "bright": 0.6, "rightOf": 10 } },
          "m": 0.55
        },
        {
          "label": { "zh": "斜纹" },
          "img": { "twoTone": { "seed": 53, "dark": 0.4, "bright": 0.9, "stripes": [7, 3] } },
          "m": 0.45
        }
      ],
      "hidden": [
        {
          "label": { "zh": "暗一些的圆斑" },
          "img": { "twoTone": { "seed": 54, "dark": 0.15, "bright": 0.5, "disc": [10, 9, 20] } },
          "m": 0.2
        }
      ],
      "solution": [
        "a = kmeansStep(img, m)",
        "b = kmeansStep(img, a)",
        "c = kmeansStep(img, b)",
        "d = arith[op=sub](img, c)",
        "t = threshold[t=0](d)",
        "out <- t"
      ],
      "naive": ["d = arith[op=sub](img, m)", "t = threshold[t=0](d)", "out <- t"]
    }
  ]
}
